{"slug":"UPDT-The-Rake-REMASTERED-New-43411","_id":"685bda437a507380078fb004","title":"New","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77ffd","gameId":2413927524,"name":"The Rake REMASTERED","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":2413927524},"features":"--[ PLAYER ]--\n• StunStick Aura: Automatically attacks the Rake when holding the StunStick.\n• No SlowDown: Always Run\n• Disable Fall Damage: Disables fall damage.\n• Infinite Stamina\n• Auto Open Door: Automatically opens the Safe House door on 'E' press.\n• Auto Open LootBox: Automatically opens all nearby supply crates.\n• Open Safe House Door: A manual button to open the door (useful for mobile players).\n\n--[ VISUALS (ESP) ]--\n• Players ESP: Shows the location of all other players, complete with a Health Bar.\n• Rake ESP: Shows the Rake's location, complete with a Health Bar.\n• Scrap ESP: Shows the location of all scrap items.\n• LootBox ESP: Shows the location of all supply crates.\n• FlareGun ESP: Shows the location of the Flare Gun if it's on the map.\n• Place ESP: Shows important locations like the Power Station, Safe House, Shop, etc.\n• Info GUI: Displays a separate, small window with critical game info (Rake's Target, Power Level, Timer).\n\n--[ ENVIRONMENT & FARMING ]--\n• Full Bright: Brightens the entire map, no flashlight needed.\n• Sell Scraps (Points): A button to sell your scrap at the shop.\n\n--[ MISCELLANEOUS ]--\n• Rejoin: Rejoins the current server.\n• Server Hop: Finds and joins a different available public server.\n• Unlock FPS: Removes the 60 FPS cap for smoother gameplay on high-end PCs.\n\n--[ SETTINGS ]--\n• UI Toggle Keybind: Set a hotkey to open/close the GUI. (Default: RightControl)\n• Unlock/Lock Mouse: Toggles the mouse between cursor and camera control. (Default: RightShift)\n\n--[ CREDITS ]--\n• Skedz Hub","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.git